# 本机私密资料隔离目录；忽略规则不是访问控制，不应让 AI 默认读取此目录。
/.private/

# 本地环境变量与常见凭据文件；不要把真实秘密保存在知识资料中。
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ed25519

# 操作系统生成文件。
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# 常见编辑器临时文件。
~$*
*.swp
*.swo

# Dependencies and build outputs.
node_modules/
.gradle/
.dart_tool/
build/
dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Machine-specific configuration and application runtime data.
local.properties
.venv/
/runtime-data/
/exports/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.log

# Never publish personal archives, local agent state, or generated analysis.
/archive/
/.omp/
/.idea/
**/.idea/
**/.kotlin/
/graphify-out/
*.jks
*.keystore
*.apk
*.aab
*.hprof
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
